# Configs reference templates

## Template source

`tester-v1/configs/reference/` is canonical. The create-model-configs skill copies from here only — never from `qwen3.5-9b-q8/` or other live model dirs.

## Keep reference updated

When you:

- Add, remove, or rename a variant directory under any real `configs/{model_slug}/`
- Change shared server.yaml / client.yaml structure, args, or default prompts intended for all new models
- Update the variant table in the create-model-configs skill

Apply the same change under `configs/reference/` (and update the skill variant table if variants changed). Prefer editing reference first, then real models if the user asks.

## Do not run on reference

Do not run `single_test_runner.py` or `model_calibration.py` on paths under `configs/reference/`.
